<title>USA: TCI sets cost basis for spin-off.</title>
<headline>TCI sets cost basis for spin-off.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele-Communications Inc said it has set the cost basis allocation associated with the spin-off of its TCI Satellite Entertainment Inc operations for tax purposes.</p>
<p>TCI's series A TCI Group common stock represents 91.30 percent of the total cost basis of the shares, and the TCI Satellite Entertainment Inc series A common stock represents 8.70 percent, the company said.</p>
</text>
